01:03:09.740 --> 01:03:10.980
On the next Justice League.

01:03:11.720 --> 01:03:13.500
I need backup here. Pass.

01:03:14.920 --> 01:03:16.880
We're Luther and the Humanite.

01:03:17.510 --> 01:03:18.670
We couldn't pick up their trail.

01:03:18.850 --> 01:03:21.470
No biggie. It's just two guys. How much trouble can they give us?

01:03:21.750 --> 01:03:24.350
Each of you is the best in the world at what you do.

01:03:24.770 --> 01:03:26.770
And I have need of your unique services.

01:03:27.470 --> 01:03:29.610
You'll all be paid most handsomely.

01:03:30.730 --> 01:03:32.830
can do one simple job.

01:03:33.050 --> 01:03:34.790
Destroy the Justice League.

01:03:35.490 --> 01:03:36.610
The Justice League premiered

01:03:36.610 --> 01:03:38.490
Friday at 7, only on Cartoon Network.

01:04:29.660 --> 01:04:30.000
Daphne.

01:04:30.030 --> 01:04:38.550
and Daffy and Daffy and Daffy!
